---
/** Editorial stack. One focused message, no split header, no eyebrow. */
---
<section id="what" class="mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:py-36">
  <div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-20">
    <div class="lg:col-span-7">
      <h2 class="display text-[2.1rem] sm:text-[2.7rem] lg:text-[3.1rem]" data-reveal>
        A Different Way to<br class="hidden sm:block" /> Think About Wellness.
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-8 max-w-[38rem] space-y-5 text-[1.02rem] leading-relaxed" data-reveal>
        <p>
          Cellove Wellness is a premium, doctor-led cellular wellness centre in
          Kuala Lumpur. We are not here to sell you a treatment from a menu.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our work begins with the person in front of us, then considers what the
          science supports, which cellular approach may be relevant, and how the
          body is likely to receive it. The thinking comes first. Everything else
          follows from it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="lg:col-span-5 lg:pt-4" data-reveal>
      <figure
        class="px-7 py-9 sm:px-9"
        style="background: var(--beige); border-left: 2px solid var(--annot);"
      >
        <blockquote class="display text-[1.6rem] leading-[1.25] sm:text-[1.9rem]">
          We don&rsquo;t follow health trends. We follow science.
        </blockquote>
        <figcaption class="mt-6 text-[0.8rem] uppercase tracking-[0.2em]" style="color: var(--graphite);">
          Patient first. Science first.
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
